e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6DRmImW-ZPwQ7kNvwHk7n0t&_nc_oc=AdqZpdj-Vz0gUoSatxeXynDWL4HVaqvCMZ1lgyDdLenlcmeliFoXG_rfNMxakoI-YvQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-we4LAgYXiNPvepzWT9OiQmkwOEkL8DAMoGKCC3w-p9Q&oe=6A2437F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IWO7CXr-JNQQ7kNvwGqe29E&_nc_oc=AdqFhRe-cdb8RXhKDi3ACLhNIia1jz65xlbWWAn_41v_aSi1IGKVr55FQTEEhhEKI6g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8-HX3V1zGv7WyYNr9pw-wUWHuGqSnXjAiwHFbNQU5-SA&oe=6A244793"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o41sTYQnUdIQ7kNvwHOEtT2&_nc_oc=AdoKLq_nv5vfWma3g1sKCoyIuy-iHqiGf9BKAa2HyQyxQKe4NrkIDEGk9JR37FYxsds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-lBr2n6voQriwl30bOhOm4cCrtxWq5pfN_CWgqJILdaQ&oe=6A241AFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=992eBwDbPmMQ7kNvwG4RY2F&_nc_oc=AdqawqRWdd_RIBHW4H8lT3B6T9JcKFs0W1tddo5G6tOBslBAk2_4lqCtRnGH06-PuPE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_E0hOjAEV_Ddca55YvavYanQzKJxb8RSlYoY6f1Xx4Nw&oe=6A241C4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RupSgA95AzcQ7kNvwE-dgnD&_nc_oc=Adp_WIfS__hidcLyvLkcV-xLqqeuJqyL363bvOyXehZjHmpqqMzgxNcgAWKn5F6Tz10&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af95-0HtqBOmNBgTILMAFbOKzXz3BNXDjpIqzSRfZLNdeQ&oe=6A243DBE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se